sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as Admin APIs
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant DBX as Databricks

    Note over Admin,DBX: 5. Member Management (After Org Setup Complete)

    Note over Admin,DBX: Step 5.1 - Add User as Member in FireFly
    Admin->>UI: Search for user
    UI->>API: GET /api/admin/search-users?q=email
    API->>DB: SELECT from user WHERE email LIKE
    DB-->>API: Return matching users
    API-->>UI: Display user list
    Admin->>UI: Select user & role
    UI->>API: POST /api/admin/add-member
    API->>DB: INSERT into member table
    DB-->>API: Success
    API-->>UI: Member added to organization

    Note over Admin,DBX: Step 5.2 - Create User SPN in Databricks (MANUAL)
    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
        Admin->>DBX: Create Service Principal for user
        Admin->>DBX: Grant SPN access to workspace
        Note right of Admin: Manual step in Databricks console
    end

    Note over Admin,DBX: Step 5.3 - Map User to SPN in FireFly
    Admin->>UI: Enter user SPN credentials
    UI->>API: POST /api/admin/databricks/accounts/map-scim-user
    API->>DBX: GET /api/2.0/accounts/{id}/scim/v2/Users?filter=email
    DBX-->>API: Return SCIM user ID
    API->>DB: UPDATE user SET accountIdUserIdMapping
    API->>DB: INSERT into userSpns table
    DB-->>API: Success
    API-->>UI: User mapped to SPN

    Note over Admin,DBX: Step 5.4 - Add User to Databricks Group (MANUAL)
    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
        Admin->>DBX: Add user/SPN to organization group
        Note right of Admin: Required for Unity Catalog access
    end
